{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i><strong>Exert your energy to climb up, you looo~ser\u2661</strong></i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2879980/extras/77f6dc79258d6c4fb35b2ee0283d570f.avif?t=1759477972\" data-has-big width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Yahoo yahoo\u2661 I'm here to play with you\u2661</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Let's take on the challenge of &quot;ZAKO NO AHIRU&quot; together\u2661</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I heard it's an insanely tough game!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You have to control a stubborn little ducky and climb to the top of the mountain\u2661</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I can't wait to see you struggle and suffer\u2661\u2661\u2661</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u2661How to play\u2661</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2879980/extras/4bc048b7fbf01522e1a2d0cdb4fe7f76.poster.avif?t=1759477972\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2879980/extras/4bc048b7fbf01522e1a2d0cdb4fe7f76.webm?t=1759477972\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2879980/extras/4bc048b7fbf01522e1a2d0cdb4fe7f76.mp4?t=1759477972\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's super easy to operate!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Just make the little ducky spray water from its mouth with a &quot;pew pew&quot; sound\u2661</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Then you can fly right over to the next platform~!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2879980/extras/f84bf121992eb1f993542e70eee0786e.poster.avif?t=1759477972\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2879980/extras/f84bf121992eb1f993542e70eee0786e.webm?t=1759477972\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2879980/extras/f84bf121992eb1f993542e70eee0786e.mp4?t=1759477972\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But... Nothing is always in plain sailing\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Because there's a chance of moving backward, it's actually pretty tough!!!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And you might mess up and fall off, forcing you to start all over again~!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2879980/extras/477ad3730f858c90f6a303d75cab36bc.poster.avif?t=1759477972\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2879980/extras/477ad3730f858c90f6a303d75cab36bc.webm?t=1759477972\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2879980/extras/477ad3730f858c90f6a303d75cab36bc.mp4?t=1759477972\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Putting unnecessary pressure on someone is so lame, isn't it?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But I won't let any foolish mistakes slide, you know \u2661</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >My sharp tongue is suuuper\u2014powerful, so you better be prepared~</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Giving up so easily is just pathetic!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You've got to hold on till 